Hi Vanessa,

The 500-word limit applies only to the Abstract field. The title, author name=
s and affiliations go in their separate fields and do not count against it. A=
ny examples quoted in the abstract do count.

There is no place for figures, tables or footnotes in that field. You can put=
 the definition of Hold and a short pair of examples directly in the text. Yo=
u can also describe the unfinished comparison, provided you make clear that i=
t is planned and has not been scored.

Best,
Charlotte

